WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=rw.

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Iyi videwo itanga intangiriro kubikoresho bya Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Hindura ukoresheje iyi buto yumukara.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Ubwa mbere, impande zombi za Arclight zishobora kuza icyarimwe.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Niba itaje na gato cyangwa amatara yijimye, bateri irashobora kuba iringaniye.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Shyira mugukoresha USB charger.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Iyo kwishyuza, amatara yicyatsi azaza.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Nyuma yiminota 15, igomba kwishyurwa byuzuye kandi igakora amasaha menshi.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Kubireka ku zuba bizakomeza bateri.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Ntuzakenera gusimbuza bateri cyangwa amatara.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Uburyo iyo impande zombi ziza ni izikoreshwa muri rusange.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Hindura muburyo bwamaso ufashe buto kumasegonda 15.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Noneho uzamure intoki zawe hanyuma wongere ukande vuba nkuko urumuri rwaka.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Ubu uri muburyo bwamaso, aho ophthalmoscope izaza

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
ubanza, hanyuma igice cyimbere loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Gusubiramo izi ntambwe bizunguruka muburyo butatu bwo gukoresha.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
Gukoresha muri rusange, amaso, hanyuma ugutwi.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Umaze guhitamo uburyo bwatoranijwe, kanda buto yumukara

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
ihindura uburyo amatara yaka kandi iherezo ryaka.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Menya neza ko ukoresha iherezo ryukuri kugirango usuzume neza.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
Ijisho ryo hanze risuzumwa ukoresheje loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Reba izaba isobanutse mugihe wegereye cyane ijisho kuri cm 6.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
Inkunga ya fondasiyo ikorwa muburebure bwamaboko ukoresheje ophthalmoscope.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
Niba ibiboneka bidasobanutse, noneho reba lens rack iri hejuru.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
Muriyi myanya, nta lens iri mu mwobo wo kureba kandi reflex igomba kuba isobanutse.
